Error: comparison operators cannot be chained
   ╭─[ main.inset:2:9 ]
   │
 2 │     low <= x < high
   │         ───┬──  
   │            ╰──── the second comparison would compare the first one's `bool`
   │ 
   │ Help: join two comparisons with `&&`, such as `a < b && b < c`
───╯
